  "question": "Within a radius of 140 kilometers, where can I locate caf\u00e9 heading toward International Circus Hall of Fame, Peru, IN from Daubenspeck Nature Reserve, Indianapolis, IN?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-86.185252 39.917104)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-86.019148 40.754214)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'cafe'\nAND ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-86.185252 39.917104)',4326)::geography, 140000)\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-86.185252 39.917104)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5);\n",
